research/audit/wave8-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-cantor-continuity-A4.log-225724-title: "On $[0,1]$ the function $x^{\\beta}$ is $\\beta$-Hölder and is $\\alpha$-Hölder for no rational $\\alpha > \\beta$, so the Hölder classes are strictly nested"
